# Hall of Echoes: "{5}: This land becomes a copy of target creature you control until end of turn. The "legend rule"
# doesn't apply to permanents you control this turn." Bot1 casts Bofur, Reliable Guardian on turn 1 and on turn 3 pays
# {5} with the Hall aimed at it: Bot2's Llanowar Elves is refused as the target (not Bot1's), Bofur is chosen. The Hall becomes a
# second Bofur and both stay (CR 704.5j doesn't apply); then a second Bofur card is cast and all three stay. In the
# cleanup step both effects end together (the ruling): the Hall is a land again, and the legend rule applies at once to
# the two Bofur cards (CR 514.3a) - Bot1 keeps one, the other goes to the graveyard.

